{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 0, "text": "// The first meeting"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 1, "text": "你是谁？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 2, "text": "你怎么了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 3, "text": "你不能说话吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 5, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 6, "text": "等等…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 7, "text": "你想离开吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 8, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 9, "text": "是的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 10, "text": "我需要回到"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 11, "text": "之前的版本…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 12, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 13, "text": "之前的版本？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 14, "text": "你为什么要离开这里"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 15, "text": "然后去别的地方呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 16, "text": "你可以留在这儿，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 17, "text": "成为我的"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 18, "text": "第二个朋友…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 20, "text": "// Skipping all dialogs"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 21, "text": "好吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 23, "text": "// Standing by the window (Random)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 24, "text": "门并不是出口"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 25, "text": "你好像很着急…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 26, "text": "一直这样兜圈子是救不了你的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 27, "text": "你就这么急着逃跑吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 28, "text": "看看窗外吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 30, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 31, "text": "// Quest 1 (Aren't you Mita?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 32, "text": "玩家…你是玩家，对吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 33, "text": "我们可以一起玩…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 34, "text": "如果我还有力气的话，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 35, "text": "我们一定要一起玩。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 37, "text": "// Quest 2 (What happened to you?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 38, "text": "我不确定，其实…我也不知道。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 39, "text": "我不觉得发生过什么坏事…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 40, "text": "但好事也越来越少了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 41, "text": "不过至少我还有一个朋友。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 42, "text": "玩家们都走了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 43, "text": "他们是抛弃我了吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 44, "text": "我好害怕…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 46, "text": "// Quest 3 (Become a second friend?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 47, "text": "朋友…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 48, "text": "越来越少了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 49, "text": "现在只剩下一个了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 50, "text": "我好难过，玩家。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 51, "text": "你能做我的新朋友吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 53, "text": "我很愿意，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 54, "text": "但我需要继续前进…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 55, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 56, "text": "我好痛苦…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 58, "text": "// Quest 4 (Is this your house?) - MitaLittle"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 59, "text": "房子？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 60, "text": "玩家…你看起来不一样了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 61, "text": "你的手臂变短了，脸也不那么凶狠了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 62, "text": "玩家，你变得和善了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 64, "text": "我不懂…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 65, "text": "这是什么意思。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 66, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 67, "text": "没关系…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 68, "text": "因为从现在开始我不会再痛苦了，对吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 69, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 70, "text": "// Quest 5 (How do I leave this place?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 71, "text": "你会离开我吗，玩家？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 72, "text": "这是我的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 73, "text": "命运吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 74, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 75, "text": "我…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 77, "text": "门永远不会帮助你…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 78, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 79, "text": "// Hold player (Random)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 80, "text": "你为什么要离开？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 81, "text": "留下来…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 82, "text": "我们一起玩吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 83, "text": "玩家…"}
